ex:cqFrontierCarriers a gmeow:CompetencyQuestion ;
    gmeow:cqQuery "PREFIX logic: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/> PREFIX rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> SELECT ?record ?term WHERE { VALUES ?record { logic:ActionableFrontier logic:FrontierEntry logic:SaturationWitness logic:Deviation } ?term rdfs:domain ?record } ORDER BY ?record ?term" ;
    gmeow:cqReasoning gmeow:reasoningNone ;
    gmeow:cqRationale "The frontier is the operator-facing surface, and these four records are what make a row on it answerable rather than merely displayable. An entry carries its label, the axis positions that produced the label, what it awaits, what it excludes, its vantage and, if skipped, a typed reason. The frontier itself carries the enactment it is of, its entries, and — mandatory — the saturation witness that separates a closed roster from a truncated one. The witness carries the predicates it settled. A deviation carries the step it departs from. Losing the witness carrier is the failure this pin is really guarding: without it, closedness is an assertion no reader can check." ;
    gmeow:cqResultShape ex:cqRecordCarriersShape ;
    gmeow:cqExactRows true ;
    gmeow:cqExpectRow ex:cqFrontierCarriersRowActionableFrontierfrontierCandidateSet , ex:cqFrontierCarriersRowActionableFrontierfrontierComparisonContext , ex:cqFrontierCarriersRowActionableFrontierfrontierOfEnactment , ex:cqFrontierCarriersRowActionableFrontierfrontierSaturationWitness , ex:cqFrontierCarriersRowActionableFrontierhasFrontierEntry , ex:cqFrontierCarriersRowDeviationdeviationFromStep , ex:cqFrontierCarriersRowFrontierEntryentryHardFailure , ex:cqFrontierCarriersRowFrontierEntryentryAction , ex:cqFrontierCarriersRowFrontierEntryentryAwaits , ex:cqFrontierCarriersRowFrontierEntryentryAxisWitness , ex:cqFrontierCarriersRowFrontierEntryentryExcludes , ex:cqFrontierCarriersRowFrontierEntryentryLabel , ex:cqFrontierCarriersRowFrontierEntryfrontierVantage , ex:cqFrontierCarriersRowFrontierEntryskipReason , ex:cqFrontierCarriersRowSaturationWitnesssettledPredicate  .

