ex:cqDispatchCarriers a gmeow:CompetencyQuestion ;
    gmeow:cqQuery "PREFIX logic: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/> PREFIX rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> SELECT ?record ?term WHERE { VALUES ?record { logic:DispatchIntent logic:IdempotencyContract logic:ResourceLease logic:ArgumentNormalization } ?term rdfs:domain ?record } ORDER BY ?record ?term" ;
    gmeow:cqReasoning gmeow:reasoningNone ;
    gmeow:cqRationale "Dispatch is where an intent becomes an external effect, and the four records here are the ones that decide whether that crossing is safe to repeat. The intent carries its target, policy, digest, normalized arguments, action-schema version, approval requirement, the enactment and step it belongs to, its idempotency contract and the journal head it expects — ten carriers, and the expected journal head is the fencing check that makes the whole set a compare-and-swap rather than a hope. The contract carries its key, scope, retention, duplicate semantics and provider evidence; the lease carries its owner, scope, expiry and fencing identity; normalization carries its recipe. Lose the recipe and two runs that normalized differently produce two digests for one intent." ;
    gmeow:cqResultShape ex:cqRecordCarriersShape ;
    gmeow:cqExactRows true ;
    gmeow:cqExpectRow ex:cqDispatchCarriersRowArgumentNormalizationnormalizationRecipe , ex:cqDispatchCarriersRowDispatchIntentexpectedJournalHead , ex:cqDispatchCarriersRowDispatchIntentintentActionSchemaVersion , ex:cqDispatchCarriersRowDispatchIntentintentApprovalRequired , ex:cqDispatchCarriersRowDispatchIntentintentDigest , ex:cqDispatchCarriersRowDispatchIntentintentIdempotency , ex:cqDispatchCarriersRowDispatchIntentintentNormalizedArguments , ex:cqDispatchCarriersRowDispatchIntentintentOfEnactment , ex:cqDispatchCarriersRowDispatchIntentintentOfStep , ex:cqDispatchCarriersRowDispatchIntentintentPolicy , ex:cqDispatchCarriersRowDispatchIntentintentTarget , ex:cqDispatchCarriersRowIdempotencyContractidempotencyDuplicateSemantics , ex:cqDispatchCarriersRowIdempotencyContractidempotencyKey , ex:cqDispatchCarriersRowIdempotencyContractidempotencyProviderEvidence , ex:cqDispatchCarriersRowIdempotencyContractidempotencyRetention , ex:cqDispatchCarriersRowIdempotencyContractidempotencyScope , ex:cqDispatchCarriersRowResourceLeasefencingIdentity , ex:cqDispatchCarriersRowResourceLeaseleaseExpiry , ex:cqDispatchCarriersRowResourceLeaseleaseOwner , ex:cqDispatchCarriersRowResourceLeaseleaseScope  .

