ex:cqEffectProtocolCarriers a gmeow:CompetencyQuestion ;
    gmeow:cqQuery "PREFIX logic: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/> PREFIX rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> SELECT ?record ?term WHERE { VALUES ?record { logic:EffectAttempt logic:ExternalEffectReceipt logic:CompensationAttempt logic:CompensationOutcome logic:ExternalOutcomeUnknown logic:ReconciliationProbe logic:ReconciliationResult logic:ReconciliationImpossible logic:RetryDispatch logic:ContradictionAdjudication logic:InformationState } ?term rdfs:domain ?record } ORDER BY ?record ?term" ;
    gmeow:cqReasoning gmeow:reasoningNone ;
    gmeow:cqRationale "Ten records, and every one of them points back at the attempt it is about. That is the design: an attempt is the only thing an external effect is ever known through, so a receipt, an unknown outcome, a probe, an impossibility, a retry and an adjudication all carry an edge to it rather than to the step or the enactment. Compensation is the exception that proves it — a compensation attempt compensates a RECEIPT, not an attempt, because you can only undo an effect you have evidence actually happened. Pinning these pairs is what stops that one edge being quietly re-pointed at the attempt, which would license compensating an effect that may never have occurred. The information-state axis is in the group because it is the one member that carries a relation on ITSELF rather than an edge into the protocol: knowledge precedence orders the positions, and an axis whose ordering lived only in prose could not be checked against the moves the protocol makes." ;
    gmeow:cqResultShape ex:cqRecordCarriersShape ;
    gmeow:cqExactRows true ;
    gmeow:cqExpectRow ex:cqEffectProtocolCarriersRowCompensationAttemptcompensatesEffect , ex:cqEffectProtocolCarriersRowCompensationOutcomecompensationReceipt , ex:cqEffectProtocolCarriersRowCompensationOutcomeoutcomeOfCompensation , ex:cqEffectProtocolCarriersRowInformationStateknowledgePrecedes ,
        ex:cqEffectProtocolCarriersRowContradictionAdjudicationadjudicatesAttempt , ex:cqEffectProtocolCarriersRowEffectAttemptattemptOfIntent , ex:cqEffectProtocolCarriersRowEffectAttemptproviderCorrelationId , ex:cqEffectProtocolCarriersRowExternalEffectReceiptreceiptEvidence , ex:cqEffectProtocolCarriersRowExternalEffectReceiptreceiptOfAttempt , ex:cqEffectProtocolCarriersRowExternalOutcomeUnknownunknownOfAttempt , ex:cqEffectProtocolCarriersRowReconciliationImpossibleimpossibleOfAttempt , ex:cqEffectProtocolCarriersRowReconciliationProbeprobesAttempt , ex:cqEffectProtocolCarriersRowReconciliationResultreconciliationVerdict , ex:cqEffectProtocolCarriersRowReconciliationResultresultOfProbe , ex:cqEffectProtocolCarriersRowRetryDispatchretryOfAttempt  .

