ex:cqRefinementCarriers a gmeow:CompetencyQuestion ;
    gmeow:cqQuery "PREFIX logic: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/> PREFIX rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> SELECT ?record ?term WHERE { VALUES ?record { logic:RefinementEpisode logic:RefinementCandidateSet logic:RefinementRejection logic:DecompositionMethod logic:PinnedExecutableSubgraph logic:LivenessCertificate logic:CapabilityGapProposal } ?term rdfs:domain ?record } ORDER BY ?record ?term" ;
    gmeow:cqReasoning gmeow:reasoningNone ;
    gmeow:cqRationale "Means-end search, recorded rather than performed silently. An episode carries the step it refines, the goal it serves, the world snapshot it searched, its budget, the decidable fragment it declared itself inside, the candidate set it produced and the pin it selected. A candidate set carries its candidates and its rejections; a rejection carries the candidate, the typed kind and the witness. A method carries its applicability, what it decomposes, its digest, its steps and the ordered sequence it yields; a pin carries the method it instantiates, its authority, its digest and its frozen step sequence. The liveness certificate carries the three things it certifies. A search that recorded only its answer would be an oracle; these carriers are what make it an argument." ;
    gmeow:cqResultShape ex:cqRecordCarriersShape ;
    gmeow:cqExactRows true ;
    gmeow:cqExpectRow ex:cqRefinementCarriersRowCapabilityGapProposalproposalBlockedStep , ex:cqRefinementCarriersRowCapabilityGapProposalproposalExpectedEffects , ex:cqRefinementCarriersRowCapabilityGapProposalproposalExpectedInputs , ex:cqRefinementCarriersRowCapabilityGapProposalproposalExpectedOutputs , ex:cqRefinementCarriersRowCapabilityGapProposalproposalMissingCapability , ex:cqRefinementCarriersRowCapabilityGapProposalproposalRequiredContract , ex:cqRefinementCarriersRowCapabilityGapProposalproposalSecurityLifecycle , ex:cqRefinementCarriersRowCapabilityGapProposalproposalVerificationMethod , ex:cqRefinementCarriersRowDecompositionMethodmethodApplicability , ex:cqRefinementCarriersRowDecompositionMethodmethodDecomposes , ex:cqRefinementCarriersRowDecompositionMethodmethodDigest , ex:cqRefinementCarriersRowDecompositionMethodmethodStep , ex:cqRefinementCarriersRowDecompositionMethodmethodYieldCell , ex:cqRefinementCarriersRowDecompositionMethodmethodYields , ex:cqRefinementCarriersRowLivenessCertificatecertifiesDeadlockFreedom , ex:cqRefinementCarriersRowLivenessCertificatecertifiesNoOrphanIntent , ex:cqRefinementCarriersRowLivenessCertificatecertifiesReachability , ex:cqRefinementCarriersRowPinnedExecutableSubgraphpinAuthority , ex:cqRefinementCarriersRowPinnedExecutableSubgraphpinDigest , ex:cqRefinementCarriersRowPinnedExecutableSubgraphpinInstantiatesMethod , ex:cqRefinementCarriersRowPinnedExecutableSubgraphpinnedStepSequence , ex:cqRefinementCarriersRowRefinementCandidateSethasRejection , ex:cqRefinementCarriersRowRefinementCandidateSetrefinementCandidate , ex:cqRefinementCarriersRowRefinementEpisodeproducedCandidateSet , ex:cqRefinementCarriersRowRefinementEpisoderefinementBudget , ex:cqRefinementCarriersRowRefinementEpisoderefinementServesGoal , ex:cqRefinementCarriersRowRefinementEpisoderefinementWorldSnapshot , ex:cqRefinementCarriersRowRefinementEpisoderefinesStep , ex:cqRefinementCarriersRowRefinementEpisodesearchFragment , ex:cqRefinementCarriersRowRefinementEpisodeselectedPin , ex:cqRefinementCarriersRowRefinementRejectionrejectedCandidate , ex:cqRefinementCarriersRowRefinementRejectionrejectionKind , ex:cqRefinementCarriersRowRefinementRejectionrejectionWitness  .

