ex:cqPrescriptionCarriers a gmeow:CompetencyQuestion ;
    gmeow:cqQuery "PREFIX logic: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/> PREFIX rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> SELECT ?record ?term WHERE { VALUES ?record { logic:PrescriptionVersion logic:PriorEnactmentRequirement logic:RevisionLens logic:ContextAssembly logic:PreparationStep logic:PreparationReceipt } ?term rdfs:domain ?record } ORDER BY ?record ?term" ;
    gmeow:cqReasoning gmeow:reasoningNone ;
    gmeow:cqRationale "What is enacted, what must have happened first, how a revision is allowed to move, and what context the run was assembled from. A prescription version carries the prescription it is of and its content digest, which is what makes enactment reference a frozen artifact rather than a moving one. A prior-enactment requirement carries the prescription required and the state it must have reached. A revision lens carries what it governs and its two round-trip laws — and the two laws are separate carriers precisely because a lens can satisfy one and fail the other. Context assembly carries what it included, what it excluded, the reason for each exclusion, the guidance version and the enactment; preparation carries the step and its receipt." ;
    gmeow:cqResultShape ex:cqRecordCarriersShape ;
    gmeow:cqExactRows true ;
    gmeow:cqExpectRow ex:cqPrescriptionCarriersRowContextAssemblyassemblyExcluded , ex:cqPrescriptionCarriersRowContextAssemblyassemblyExclusionReason , ex:cqPrescriptionCarriersRowContextAssemblyassemblyForEnactment , ex:cqPrescriptionCarriersRowContextAssemblyassemblyGuidanceVersion , ex:cqPrescriptionCarriersRowContextAssemblyassemblyIncluded , ex:cqPrescriptionCarriersRowPreparationReceiptreceiptOfPreparation , ex:cqPrescriptionCarriersRowPreparationSteppreparationActivity , ex:cqPrescriptionCarriersRowPreparationSteppreparationOf , ex:cqPrescriptionCarriersRowPrescriptionVersionprescriptionDigest , ex:cqPrescriptionCarriersRowPrescriptionVersionprescriptionOf , ex:cqPrescriptionCarriersRowPriorEnactmentRequirementrequiredPriorPrescription , ex:cqPrescriptionCarriersRowPriorEnactmentRequirementrequiredPriorState , ex:cqPrescriptionCarriersRowRevisionLenslensGetPutHolds , ex:cqPrescriptionCarriersRowRevisionLenslensGoverns , ex:cqPrescriptionCarriersRowRevisionLenslensPutGetHolds  .

