ex:cqRecoveryCarriers a gmeow:CompetencyQuestion ;
    gmeow:cqQuery "PREFIX logic: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/> PREFIX rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> SELECT ?record ?term WHERE { VALUES ?record { logic:EnactmentCheckpoint logic:StepCheckpoint logic:CheckpointRestore logic:EnactmentCohort logic:ClockAttribution logic:DeadlineConsumption logic:AxisTransitionLaw logic:OperationalCapabilityGap } ?term rdfs:domain ?record } ORDER BY ?record ?term" ;
    gmeow:cqReasoning gmeow:reasoningNone ;
    gmeow:cqRationale "Recovery, cohorts, clocks, deadlines and the transition laws they are checked against. A checkpoint carries the enactment or step it is of and its recovery witness; a restore carries the checkpoint it restores, the enactment it restores into and the descriptor hash that proves the two match. That hash is the carrier the whole record turns on: without it a restore is indistinguishable from a rematerialization that merely looks similar. An axis transition law carries the axis it governs and the transitions it admits, which is what lets deadlock-freedom be proved over an axis rather than asserted about it." ;
    gmeow:cqResultShape ex:cqRecordCarriersShape ;
    gmeow:cqExactRows true ;
    gmeow:cqExpectRow ex:cqRecoveryCarriersRowAxisTransitionLawlawAdmits , ex:cqRecoveryCarriersRowAxisTransitionLawlawGovernsAxis , ex:cqRecoveryCarriersRowCheckpointRestorerestoreDescriptorHash , ex:cqRecoveryCarriersRowCheckpointRestorerestoreOfEnactment , ex:cqRecoveryCarriersRowCheckpointRestorerestoresCheckpoint , ex:cqRecoveryCarriersRowClockAttributionclockObservedAt , ex:cqRecoveryCarriersRowClockAttributionclockSource , ex:cqRecoveryCarriersRowDeadlineConsumptiondeadlineExhausted , ex:cqRecoveryCarriersRowDeadlineConsumptiondeadlineOfEnactment , ex:cqRecoveryCarriersRowEnactmentCheckpointcheckpointOfEnactment , ex:cqRecoveryCarriersRowEnactmentCheckpointrecoveryWitness , ex:cqRecoveryCarriersRowEnactmentCohortcohortMember , ex:cqRecoveryCarriersRowOperationalCapabilityGapgapBlockedStep , ex:cqRecoveryCarriersRowStepCheckpointcheckpointOfStep  .

