ex:cqRefinementRelations a gmeow:CompetencyQuestion ;
    gmeow:cqQuery "PREFIX owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> SELECT ?term WHERE { ?term a owl:ObjectProperty . FILTER(STRSTARTS(STR(?term), \"https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/refinement\")) } ORDER BY ?term" ;
    gmeow:cqReasoning gmeow:reasoningNone ;
    gmeow:cqRationale "The refinement surface is eleven relations, and the roster is what makes means-end search inspectable rather than an evaluator private note. Four of them are the typed rejections, one per gate; two are the one-step expansion and its transitive closure, kept apart because a constraint about immediate decomposition must not range over the whole tree and because a self-edge in the closure is the decomposition cycle no budget increase repairs; the rest carry the budget, the goal served, the world snapshot searched, the candidate and the method it instantiates. Pinning all eleven stops a twelfth appearing without the reader ever being told the surface grew." ;
    gmeow:cqResultShape ex:cqKernelRosterShape ;
    gmeow:cqExactRows true ;
    gmeow:cqExpectRow ex:cqRefinementRelationsRowrefinementBudget , ex:cqRefinementRelationsRowrefinementCandidate , ex:cqRefinementRelationsRowrefinementCandidateMethod , ex:cqRefinementRelationsRowrefinementExpands , ex:cqRefinementRelationsRowrefinementReaches , ex:cqRefinementRelationsRowrefinementRejectedOnApproval , ex:cqRefinementRelationsRowrefinementRejectedOnCapability , ex:cqRefinementRelationsRowrefinementRejectedOnPrecondition , ex:cqRefinementRelationsRowrefinementRejectedOnResource , ex:cqRefinementRelationsRowrefinementServesGoal , ex:cqRefinementRelationsRowrefinementWorldSnapshot  .

