ex:cqRuleAtomPredicates a gmeow:CompetencyQuestion ;
    gmeow:cqQuery "PREFIX rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> SELECT DISTINCT ?term WHERE { ?atom rdf:predicate ?term . FILTER(STRSTARTS(STR(?term), \"https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/\")) } ORDER BY ?term" ;
    gmeow:cqReasoning gmeow:reasoningNone ;
    gmeow:cqRationale "The derivation rules are data too, and their head and body atoms name predicates in the rdf:predicate position. This roster is therefore the answer to what the kernel actually DERIVES as opposed to what it merely constrains: a predicate here is written or read by a rule, and the frontier label, axis witness and refinement rejection predicates dominate the list for exactly that reason. Read against the law-predicate roster it makes a real distinction visible — a predicate constrained but never derived must be asserted by an author, and a predicate derived but never constrained is produced under no check at all." ;
    gmeow:cqResultShape ex:cqKernelRosterShape ;
    gmeow:cqExactRows true ;
    gmeow:cqExpectRow ex:cqRuleAtomPredicatesRowassessedAgent , ex:cqRuleAtomPredicatesRowassessmentDimension , ex:cqRuleAtomPredicatesRowassessmentLevel , ex:cqRuleAtomPredicatesRowassessmentSubject , ex:cqRuleAtomPredicatesRowentryAction , ex:cqRuleAtomPredicatesRowentryAwaits , ex:cqRuleAtomPredicatesRowentryAxisWitness , ex:cqRuleAtomPredicatesRowentryExcludes , ex:cqRuleAtomPredicatesRowentryLabel , ex:cqRuleAtomPredicatesRowgapBlockedStep , ex:cqRuleAtomPredicatesRowgateVerdict , ex:cqRuleAtomPredicatesRowhasThresholdRow , ex:cqRuleAtomPredicatesRowleaseScope , ex:cqRuleAtomPredicatesRowlevelAtOrAbove , ex:cqRuleAtomPredicatesRowmethodDecomposes , ex:cqRuleAtomPredicatesRowmethodStep , ex:cqRuleAtomPredicatesRowmethodYieldCell , ex:cqRuleAtomPredicatesRowmethodYields , ex:cqRuleAtomPredicatesRowprecondition , ex:cqRuleAtomPredicatesRowprobesSchema , ex:cqRuleAtomPredicatesRowprojectsLadderEdge , ex:cqRuleAtomPredicatesRowproposalBlockedStep , ex:cqRuleAtomPredicatesRowproposalMissingCapability , ex:cqRuleAtomPredicatesRowrefinementCandidateMethod , ex:cqRuleAtomPredicatesRowrefinementExpands , ex:cqRuleAtomPredicatesRowrefinementReaches , ex:cqRuleAtomPredicatesRowrefinementRejectedOnApproval , ex:cqRuleAtomPredicatesRowrefinementRejectedOnCapability , ex:cqRuleAtomPredicatesRowrefinementRejectedOnPrecondition , ex:cqRuleAtomPredicatesRowrefinementRejectedOnResource , ex:cqRuleAtomPredicatesRowskipReason , ex:cqRuleAtomPredicatesRowsourceDimension , ex:cqRuleAtomPredicatesRowthresholdLevel  .

